flowchart TD
R[Incoming tool request] --> S{Grant signature + issuer valid?}
S -- no --> D[Deny + audit]
S -- yes --> B{Human/workload/agent/case/run/task binding valid?}
B -- no --> D
B -- yes --> A{Audience/tool/operation/resource/data/region valid?}
A -- no --> D
A -- yes --> P{Proof-of-possession valid and fresh?}
P -- no --> D
P -- yes --> V{Not revoked; nonce unused; uses remain?}
V -- no --> D
V -- yes --> H{Approval requirement satisfied?}
H -- no --> D
H -- yes --> BR{Blast-radius budget available?}
BR -- no --> D
BR -- yes --> E[Reserve budget and invoke typed tool]
